WEBVTT

00:12:29.036 --> 00:12:33.123
They invested in a workforce
with their clinicians and their nurses

00:12:33.123 --> 00:12:34.833
and their community health workers.

00:12:34.833 --> 00:12:38.712
They invested in testing
and contact tracers.

00:12:39.296 --> 00:12:41.465
And they invested
in changing of some laws,

00:12:41.507 --> 00:12:42.966
some public health laws,

00:12:42.966 --> 00:12:45.844
that allowed the governments
to act where necessary

00:12:45.844 --> 00:12:48.972
while keeping in mind
the rights of people.

00:12:49.014 --> 00:12:51.600
And so what we've seen
in so many countries,

00:12:51.642 --> 00:12:53.268
mainly in the East,

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.188
mainly in Asia, in the Pacific,

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.564
across Africa,

00:12:57.606 --> 00:13:00.025
they may not have had
the perfect systems in place.